Timecode: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column hours smallint
column minutes smallint
column seconds smallint
column frames smallint
column rate_numerator integer
column rate_denominator integer
column drop_frame boolean

example {"hours":1,"minutes":0,"seconds":0,"frames":0,"rate":"25/1","drop_frame":false}
text none
json {"hours":1,"minutes":0,"seconds":0,"frames":0,"rate":"25/1","drop_frame":false}
stored hours 1
stored minutes 0
stored seconds 0
stored frames 0
stored rate_numerator 25
stored rate_denominator 1
stored drop_frame FALSE

